<!-- r55 (the one-launcher unification round): the Settings "Installed
     components" section: the family's single home since the launcher
     consolidation. The five component names below deliberately MATCH
     the launcher labels shipped by the corresponding builds
     (app_launcher_name in src/<flavor>/res/values/strings.xml and the
     editor's editor_app_name): if a future round renames a launcher
     label, rename its mirror here in the same commit so the section
     never disagrees with what the system shows in App info. -->
